<h3 class="muted">Access & Location</h3>
<div class="faq-block">
  <div class="faqquestion" data-action="click->faq#toggle">
    <h5>How do I get to the hotel?</h5>
    <h5 class="plus">+</h5>
  </div>
  <div class="faqanswer d-none" data-faq-target="answer">
    <h6>
      We are located near Asakusa Station & Tawaramachi Station, with easy access via subway and bus.
      Please refer to our <%= link_to "map", about_us_path %> for the exact address and check the <%= link_to "access", about_us_path %> section, or contact us via this <%= link_to "form", new_contact_message_path  %> for specific instructions.
    </h6>
  </div>
  <hr>
  <div class="faqquestion" data-action="click->faq#toggle">
    <h5>Do you offer airport pickup?</h5>
    <h5 class="plus">+</h5>
  </div>
  <div class="faqanswer d-none" data-faq-target="answer">
    <h6>Airport pickup is not provided, but we can guide you on the best route.</h6>
  </div>
  <hr>
  <div class="faqquestion" data-action="click->faq#toggle">
    <h5>Is parking available nearby?</h5>
    <h5 class="plus">+</h5>
  </div>
  <div class="faqanswer d-none" data-faq-target="answer">
    <h6>
      There is no on-site parking, but several paid parking lots are available within walking distance of the hotel.
    </h6>
  </div>
</div>
